10. TERM AND TERMINATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

10.1 Term. This Agreement takes effect when Licensee first downloads, installs,
     copies, or uses the Software and continues until terminated in accordance
     with this Section or until the Separate Agreement expires or terminates,
     whichever occurs first.

10.2 Automatic Termination. The license granted in Section 2.1 terminates
     automatically, without notice and without prejudice to any other remedy, if
     Licensee breaches any provision of this Agreement or of the Separate
     Agreement, or if the Separate Agreement expires or is terminated for any
     reason.

10.3 Termination for Convenience by NodeX. Where the Software has been made
     available without charge and no Separate Agreement specifies a fixed term,
     NodeX may terminate this Agreement at any time upon thirty (30) days'
     written notice.

10.4 Effect of Termination. Upon termination or expiration, Licensee shall
     immediately cease all use of the Software and, within thirty (30) days,
     delete or destroy all copies of the Software in its possession or control,
     including copies on backup media to the extent technically practicable, and
     shall certify such deletion or destruction in writing upon NodeX's request.

10.5 Survival. Sections 1, 2.2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10.4, 10.5, 11, and 12 survive
     termination or expiration of this Agreement.

